.TH mnnn-ingest-service-redis 1  "mnnn-ingest-service-redis 1.11.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-ingest\-service\-redis \- Flags shared by every service
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn ingest service redis\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] <\fB\-\-uri\fR> [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-port\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-username\fR] [\fB\-\-password\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-password\-env\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-password\-stdin\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-db\-index\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-tls\fR] [\fB\-\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-pattern\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-value\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-to\fR] [\fB\-\-batch\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-symbol\fR] [\fB\-\-duration\fR] [\fB\-\-map\fR] [\fB\-\-rejects\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-recursive\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Flags shared by every service
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-uri\fR \fI<URI>\fR
Host or redis:// / rediss:// URI
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-port\fR \fI<PORT>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-username\fR \fI<USERNAME>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-password\fR \fI<PASSWORD>\fR
Password (prefer \-\-password\-env / \-\-password\-stdin: flags end up in shell history)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-password\-env\fR \fI<VAR>\fR
Read the password from this environment variable
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-password\-stdin\fR
Read the password from stdin
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-db\-index\fR \fI<DB_INDEX>\fR [default: 0]
Logical database index (`\-\-db` is taken by the global database\-file flag)
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-tls\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-key\fR \fI<KEY>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-pattern\fR \fI<PATTERN>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<KIND>\fR [default: auto]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
stream
.IP \(bu 2
list
.IP \(bu 2
zset
.IP \(bu 2
hash
.IP \(bu 2
string
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-value\-format\fR \fI<VALUE_FORMAT>\fR [default: json]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
csv
.IP \(bu 2
fields
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<FROM>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TO>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-batch\fR \fI<BATCH>\fR [default: 1000]

.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Source name (created if unknown)
.TP
\fB\-\-symbol\fR \fI<SYMBOL>\fR
Symbol, e.g. BTC/USDT, BTC\-USD or BTCUSDT
.TP
\fB\-\-duration\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
Bar duration, e.g. 5m, 1h, 1d
.TP
\fB\-\-map\fR \fI<COL=FIELD>\fR
Column mapping `<col>=<field>` (fields: timestamp, open, high, low, close, volume). Repeatable
.TP
\fB\-\-rejects\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write rejected rows (with reasons) to this CSV
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Re\-process even if this exact input was already ingested
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-recursive\fR
For a directory \-\-path: only its top level (default: search subdirectories too)
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<TIMEOUT>\fR [default: 30]
Timeout in seconds
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v1.11.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
